426:- voiceover: "The same sealed engine compares firefighting plans: control lines, helicopter drops, hand crews, peat injection. It only plans with resources the commander says exist. Options resting on placeholder numbers, like cloud seeding, are tagged speculative and kept out. In the exercise scenario, five hundred seventy-eight hectares burn with the plan against eight hundred forty-seven without: thirty-two percent less. That difference is a model estimate of about two hundred ten thousand tonnes of carbon dioxide equivalent."
