475:- voiceover: "Who is it for? Disaster managers, Manggala Agni fire commanders, provincial governments, researchers comparing fire models, and auditors checking what was known. It runs in a browser on free open data; adding a region is a bounding box. Two honest limits: the peat map is synthetic, so carbon numbers are illustrative, and the model's edge is small. That is why every forecast is now on the record. SekatApi — forecasts on the record."
